# Supabase Edge Functions (MyKidApp)

This project uses **Publishable** and **Secret** API keys (not legacy JWT anon/service_role). The Edge Functions gateway does not verify user JWTs when using these keys.

- **Always deploy with `--no-verify-jwt`**, or the gateway returns 401 Invalid JWT and requests never reach the function.
- Verification is done inside each function via `supabase.auth.getUser()`.

**Commands:**
```bash
# Deploy all functions
supabase functions deploy --no-verify-jwt

# Deploy one function
supabase functions deploy <name> --no-verify-jwt
```

When adding new Edge Functions or updating docs that mention deploy, include `--no-verify-jwt` in the deploy command. Reference: [Supabase API keys](https://supabase.com/docs/guides/api/api-keys), [docs/edge-function-setup.md](docs/edge-function-setup.md).
